; For the pitch, which frames start a sentence. A segment's frames n and send in (two cards); out a card for each of
; its frames: 1 for the first frame after a segment that ends a sentence (and the very first frame), else 0.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            seg     INP   n        03-17: a segment, and its frames
  04                    INP   send
  05            frm     CLA   n
  06                    SUB   00
  07                    TAC   eos
  08                    STO   n
  09                    OUT   ns
  10                    CLA   z
  11                    STO   ns
  12                    JMP   frm
  13            eos     CLA   send     13-17: it ends a sentence: the next frame starts one
  14                    SUB   00
  15                    TAC   seg
  16                    CLA   00
  17                    STO   ns
  18                    JMP   seg
  30            n       DATA  0
  31            send    DATA  0
  32            ns      DATA  1
  33            z       DATA  0
